- Enterprise pipeline $18M weighted, up from $12M last quarter\
- Two logos slipped from Q4 to Q1 (Halden, Vero-North) \'97 deal-desk\
\'a0 write-up in the appendix\
\
Product / eng:\
- Analytics 2.0 GA shipped 07-Aug, ~40% of paid users adopted in the\
\'a0 first two weeks\
- Migration off the legacy queue system landed cleanly; incident count\
\'a0 down 60% MoM\
- Two P0 spikes are still on the risk log \'97 Ravi has an update slide\
\
Ask from you:\
- Sign off on the CS reorg slide (Priya sent the alt version last night)\
- Two-sentence take on why we're not raising the mid-market list price\
\'a0 yet\
- Anything you want to add to the "what we got wrong" section\
\
I'll pull it into the shared deck folder once your comments land. Zoom\
tomorrow 4pm if you want to walk through it live.\
\
Regards,\
Tony\
